ntract ac-17`: GET /api/meta/workflows returns all workflows (2 tests)\n- `@api-contract ac-18`: GET /api/meta/observations with resolved filter (5 tests)\n- `@api-contract ac-19`: GET /api/search searches across all entities (9 tests)\n- `@api-contract ac-20`: GET /api/validate returns ValidationResult (5 tests)\n- `@api-contract ac-21`: GET /api/alignment returns stats and warnings (5 tests)\n\nTrait ACs from `@trait-json-output` and `@trait-filterable-list` annotated as N/A at top of file (HTTP API vs CLI pattern).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] All vitest unit tests pass (shards 1 and 2 verified, 1376+ tests pass)\n- [x] No existing tests broken by deleting the static analysis files\n- [x] E2E tests use daemon fixture (isolated temp dir, running daemon via bun)\n- [x] E2E tests annotated with `// AC: @api-contract ac-N` annotations\n- [x] Trait ACs annotated as N/A with reasons (JSON output and filterable list are CLI traits)\n- [x] Local review: test quality, isolation, regression check\n\nNote: E2E tests require bun runtime. They run with `npm run test:e2e` in the web-ui package.\n\nTask: @task-e2e-daemon-meta-validation-api\nSpec: @api-contract\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
